cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software with its exact version, commit and configuration hash."
type: software
title: "HoloVirtualBattery / HoloEnergy: an external electro-thermal energy wrapper for HoloOcean"
authors:
  - family-names: Bedei
    given-names: Andrea
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndreaBedei1/HoloVirtualBattery"
url: "https://github.com/AndreaBedei1/HoloVirtualBattery"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Provenance-aware energy simulation layer for HoloOcean marine robots:
  evidence registry with relation-capped grades, arbitrary actuator layouts
  with wrench allocation and wrench-equivalent actuation, L0/L1 battery models,
  real-component electrical models and observe-only DESERT communication energy,
  verified tick by tick on a drag-patched HoloOcean 2.3.0 backend.
  Software and native simulator checks do not establish physical vehicle validation.
keywords:
  - marine robotics
  - battery modelling
  - electro-thermal simulation
  - HoloOcean
  - reproducibility
